      "text": "Sec. 30-3. Advocating overthrow of Government."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A person who advocates, or with knowledge of its contents knowingly publishes, sells or distributes any document which advocates or with knowledge of its purpose, knowingly becomes a member of any organization which advocates the overthrow or reformation of the existing form of government of this State by violence or unlawful means commits a Class 3 felony."
    },
    {
      "type": "source",
      "text": "(Source: P.A. 77-2638.)"
    }
